{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10188","headline":"故吏部郎中赠给事中韦公挽歌二首 一 · 李嘉佑","name":"故吏部郎中赠给事中韦公挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神理今何在，斯人竟若斯。\n颜渊徒有德，伯道且无儿。\n白发今非老，青云数有奇。\n谁言夕郎拜，翻向夜台悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}